href="https://github.com/smart-swimmingpool/grafana-dashboard"target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Visit Repository&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - Dashboard JSON and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a
href="https://smart-swimmingpool.com/docs/pool-controller/"&gt;Pool Controller Setup&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - Ensure your controller is running&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a
href="https://smart-swimmingpool.com/docs/home-assistant-integration/"&gt;Home Assistant Integration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - Connect the controller to Home Assistant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
